abstract: >-
  Research demonstrator for street-tree service requests anchored to the tree
  in the City of Zürich open tree cadastre, with resident reporting, public
  tracking without personal data, a staff desk, and a city-wide analysis of
  location ambiguity and map-selection rules under touch error.
